  "summary": "The existing telemetry stack now links a bounded BFF private-context span to API/database work. Transaction-local diagnostic context becomes optional immutable outbox origin evidence. Redis publication, projection and webhook delivery attempts have separate linked spans. Event details expose only an authorized opaque trace ID. A same-origin viewer route rechecks record access and uses a fixed configured viewer. Historical or absent trace states remain explicit. Raw errors, framework spans, baggage, trace state, arbitrary resource attributes and financial values are excluded. API 3.6.0 documents the optional response field; generated clients and examples are aligned.",
